# project:packages/apps/Aperture
# On open: if camera privacy is OFF and HI847S (id 2) is missing, wake
# titan2-sensor-privacy (cam_allow → aux publish). CameraX waits before
# ProcessCameraProvider so the lens list is not cached as 0+1.
